            <li><strong>Metathalamus &amp; Epithalamus:</strong> <strong>CGL</strong> (<em>brachium colliculi sup.</em> &rarr; <em>radiatio optica</em> &rarr; Br. 17, 18, 19 látás) és <strong>CGM</strong> (<em>brachium colliculi inf.</em> &rarr; <em>radiatio acustica</em> &rarr; Br. 41, 42 hallás) &bull; <strong>Epithalamus:</strong> <em>trigonum habenulae</em> (<em>nucl. habenulae med. et lat.</em> &larr; <em>stria medullaris thalami</em> &rarr; <em>nucl. interpeduncularis</em>), <em>commissura habenularum</em>, <em>corpus pineale</em> (melatonin &rarr; cirkadián ritmus).</li>
